{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NFFUxkb7uDTUyZYwc7VdZu","type":"tool_result","content":"283:- `input.codeLabel(code)`: a code as a person reads it: 'W' (or the keyboard's own letter there), 'Space', '↑', 'Left click', and a gamepad button by its symbol on the controller in use ('A', '✕', 'B'...; glyphs picks the family)\n297:- `input.padStyle()`: the controller family whose symbols label() shows: glyphs, or with glyphs 'auto' the one its name says\n326:- `input.glyphs = 'auto'`: the gamepad's button symbols for label(): 'auto' (from the controller's name) | 'xbox' | 'playstation' | 'nintendo' | 'generic' (positions)\n360:- `E.font.title(g, s, x, y, o = {})`: Big logo text for title screens: scaled glyphs with a vertical color gradient, an outline and an extruded 3D edge. title(g, 'CASTLE OF NIGHT', x, y, { scale: 3, colors: ['#fff6c8', '#ffd36a', '#e07a2a'], outline: '#1a0c10', depth: 3, depthColor: '#6a2a1a', align: 'center' })\n----\n86:- **Controls**: every action of the current preset, rebound by pressing the new key, mouse button or gamepad button (a conflict is said and nothing changes; Escape, Enter, the F keys, Start, the arrow keys and the d-pad stay with the menus, so a player can't lock themselves out), the controller (dead zone, invert aim, button symbols: Xbox, PlayStation, Nintendo or positions, vibration) and the touch buttons (always, automatic or hidden; right or left side; size; opacity). Restore defaults resets the controls and never touches a save.\n232:- Styles give each tile its look: `stone` (with `moss`), `brick`, `wood`, `metal`, `ground` (grass top when open to the sky, with `flower`), `block` (bevelled), `bonus` (`?` block, `glyph` option), `pipe`, `plank`, `spikes`, `ladder`, `liquid`, `plain`; `mat` gives a solid tile's face any material (`E.MATERIALS`).\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174816__xe73303/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_too