{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MNcVUxbE8bp3SVMdXhmXrF","type":"tool_result","content":"974:    const host = this.screen.canvas.parentElement || document.body, box = document.createElement('div'), side = left ? 'left' : 'right';\n986:      const st = this._startEl = document.createElement('div'), b = document.createElement('button'); st.dataset.sys = 'touch';\n1218:      const mkEl = (s, css) => { const d = document.createElement('div'); d.style.cssText = 'position:absolute;pointer-events:none;border-radius:50%;z-index:3;' + css; d.style.width = d.style.height = s + 'px'; this.screen.canvas.parentElement.appendChild(d); return d; };\n2254:    _errBox = document.createElement('div'); _errBox.id = 'my3d2dge-error'; _errBox.setAttribute('role', 'alert');\n3118:  const box = document.createElement('div'); box.id = 'e3-corner'; box.dataset.sys = 'corner';\n3226:    if (!el) { el = document.createElement('div'); el.id = 'e3-boot'; el.setAttribute('role', 'status'); document.body.appendChild(el); }\n3242:    const row = document.createElement('div'); row.textContent = t; if (!ok) row.className = 'no'; s.appendChild(row);\n9163:class Shell {\n10161:    const p = document.createElement('div'); p.style.cssText = 'position:fixed;inset:0;visibility:hidden;pointer-events:none;padding:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) env(safe-area-inset-right,0px) env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px) env(safe-area-inset-left,0px)';\n484:- `game.menu(name)`: open the menu (the corner's menu button and the touch START do it): a pausable scene (or a game started without scenes) pauses on its pause screen; any other scene, a title, waits under the settings. menu('settings') or menu('controls') opens that screen. Without a menu (menu: false, or the agent edition) it pauses a scene in play. Returns true when a menu opened\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174816__xe73303/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_